      "q": "9. Give the reason why platinum, gold, and silver are used to make jewelry.",
      "a": "Platinum, gold, and silver are used to make jewelry due to their low reactivity. These metals are placed at the bottom of the activity series and are also called noble metals.\nThey do not corrode when exposed to air, water, or chemicals. Thus they do not lose their shine and have a bright luster, which makes them suitable for making jewelry.\nThese metals are also highly malleable and ductile, so they can be shaped and designed as required."
