      "a": "Hint \u2013 a more reactive element will replace a lesser reactive element.\n(i). From reactions (a) and (b), we can say that the most reactive element is B because it can replace both A and C from their compounds.\n(ii). From reactions (b) and (c), we can say that element C is the least reactive as it has been replaced both by A and B."
